 style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">常见标签速认</div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">通用容器</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">段落</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">链接</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;img&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">图片</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">按钮</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;input&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">输入框</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;max-width:70%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:12px 12px 4px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">Help me make a personal homepage</div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px\">Okay, here is your index.html:</div>\n        <div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\">\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">h1</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>Xiaoli's homepage<span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">h1</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">p</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>I like climbing mountains and taking pictures. <span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">p</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">a</span> <span class=\"terminal-a\">href</span>=<span class=\"terminal-g\">\"/photos\"</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>View my photo album<span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">a</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n        </div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">view-source:https://my-first-page.vercel.app</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.8\">\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">1</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt;</span>Xiaoli’s homepage<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">2</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</span>I like hiking and taking pictures. <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">3</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a</span> <span style=\"color:var(--warning)\">href=\"/photos\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&gt;</span>View my photo album<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/a&gt;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:12px 14px;border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px\">Xiaoli's homepage</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:4px;outline:2px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px\">I like hiking and taking pictures. </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;margin-top:4px\">View my photo album →</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.8;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"background:var(--brand-light);border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/p&gt;</span></span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/a&gt;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Common tag recognition</div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Universal container</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Paragraph</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Link</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;img&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Picture</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Button</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;input&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Input box</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"html-anat\"><span class=\"html-punc\">&lt;</span><span class=\"ap html-tagname\" data-ap=\"open\">a</span><span class=\"ap html-attr\" data-ap=\"attr\"> href=\"https://vibe.guide\"</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&gt;</span><span class=\"ap html-content\" data-ap=\"content\">点我看看</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"ap html-tagname\" data-ap=\"close\">a</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&gt;</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"html-anat\"><span class=\"html-punc\">&lt;</span><span class=\"ap html-tagname\" data-ap=\"open\">a</span><span class=\"ap html-attr\" data-ap=\"attr\"> href=\"https://vibe.guide\"</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&gt;</span><span class=\"ap html-content\" data-ap=\"content\">Click to see</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"ap html-tagname\" data-ap=\"close\">a</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&gt;</span></div>","parts":[{"key":"open","cn":"开始标签","en":"Opening Tag","desc":"尖括号加标签名，告诉浏览器「这里开始」","desc_en":"Add angle brackets to the tag name to tell the browser \"Start here\""},{"key":"attr","cn":"属性","en":"Attribute","desc":"写在开始标签里的附加信息，如链接地址、图片路径","desc_en":"Additional information written in the start tag, such as link address and image path"},{"key":"content","cn":"内容","en":"Content","desc":"两对尖括号之间的部分，改文案只动这里","desc_en":"The part between the two pairs of angle brackets, only change this part when modifying the copy."},{"key":"close","cn":"结束标签","en":"Closing Tag","desc":"多一个斜杠，告诉浏览器「到这里结束」","desc_en":"An extra slash tells the browser \"end here\""}]},"variants":[{"cn":"div 通用容器","en":"div","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt; … &lt;/div&gt;</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt; … &lt;/div&gt;</span>","when":"没有更合适的语义标签时，用它组织内容和布局","when_en":"Use it to organize content and layout when there are no more appropriate semantic tags"},{"cn":"h1~h3 与 p","en":"Headings & p","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;</span>","when":"标题和段落，文章的骨架","when_en":"Titles and paragraphs, the skeleton of the article"},{"cn":"a 与 img","en":"Link & Image","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt; &lt;img&gt;</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt; &lt;img&gt;</span>","when":"a 跳网址，img 贴图片","when_en":"a jumps to the URL, img posts the picture"},{"cn":"button 与 input","en":"Button & Input","demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt; &lt;input&gt;</span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt; &lt;input&gt;</span>","when":"页面上能点能填的交互件","when_en":"Interactive parts that can be clicked and filled on the page"}],"use":[{"t":"把标题、图片和章节组织成清楚的网页结构","m":"html-reading"},{"t":"<b>制作可直接分享的页面</b>：官网、落地页、图文文章和报告，发一个网址就能在浏览器打开","m":"html-share"},{"t":"<b>加入图片、链接和交互</b>：页面可以跳转、填写表单、播放媒体或触发操作","m":"html-interactive"},{"t":"把 Markdown 内容转成需要正式呈现的网页","m":"html-from-markdown"}],"dont":[{"t":"标签打开后没有正确关闭，容易破坏后续结构","m":"html-unclosed-bad","bad":true},{"t":"标签交叉嵌套，浏览器难以得到预期结构","m":"html-cross-bad","bad":true},{"t":"不要把页面正文放进文档元数据区域（head）；正常可见内容应组织在 body 中","m":"html-head-bad","bad":true},{"t":"不要用文字处理软件另存 HTML，以免破坏标签结构","m":"html-word-bad","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"文章页的大标题只是放大的普通文字，“查看原文”也是可点击的普通容器。应该怎样修改？","options":[{"id":"semantic-elements","label":"用合适的 HTML 标题和链接元素表达结构与跳转","feedback":"HTML 元素会把标题层级和链接角色交给浏览器识别，页面外观仍可继续由 CSS 控制。","correct":true},{"id":"visual-styling-only","label":"保留现有容器，只继续加大字号并换成更醒目的颜色","feedback":"视觉样式能改变外观，却不会让浏览器、键盘和辅助技术识别标题结构或链接角色。","correct":false},{"id":"flatten-to-image","label":"把标题和原文入口做进一张图片，再给整张图绑定点击","feedback":"图片会丢失可选择文字和清楚的内容结构，入口范围与含义也难以被正确识别。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"An article's main heading is only enlarged generic text, and View source is a clickable generic container. How should this be fixed?","options":[{"id":"semantic-elements","label":"Use appropriate HTML heading and link elements for the structure and navigation","feedback":"HTML elements expose heading hierarchy and link behavior to the browser while CSS can still control appearance.","correct":true},{"id":"visual-styling-only","label":"Keep the generic containers and only increase the size and color contrast","feedback":"Visual styling changes appearance but does not give browsers, keyboards, or assistive tools the missing roles.","correct":false},{"id":"flatten-to-image","label":"Put the heading and source action into one image and make the whole image clickable","feedback":"An image removes selectable text and clear document structure, and its single click target obscures the action's meaning.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请先检查这篇文章的 HTML 结构：页面主标题使用正确的标题元素，“查看原文”使用真实链接，普通操作使用按钮。保留现有视觉样式，并用键盘确认链接和按钮都能正常访问。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Review this article's HTML structure: use the correct heading element for the page title, a real link for View source, and buttons for actions. Preserve the visual styling and verify every link and button with a keyboard."}},"references":[{"title":"用 HTML 组织内容","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content","title_en":"Structuring content with HTML"},{"title":"HTML：超文本标记语言","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML","title_en":"HTML: HyperText Markup Language"}],"scenes":["AI 给你的 index.html","浏览器「查看源代码」","DevTools 检查元素","常见标签速认小抄"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Build page structure","m":"html-reading"},{"t":"Mark headings and sections","m":"html-share"},{"t":"Create forms and links with native behavior","m":"html-interactive"},{"t":"Give content machine-readable meaning","m":"html-from-markdown"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use generic div elements for every role","m":"html-unclosed-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Choose tags only for their default appearance","m":"html-cross-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Skip heading levels to get a larger font","m":"html-head-bad","bad":true},{"t":"Put unsafe user content directly into HTML","m":"html-word-bad","bad":true}],"scenes":["Page document","Article","Form","Navigation"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;max-width:70%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:12px 12px 4px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">Help me make a personal homepage</div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px\">Okay, here is your index.html:</div>\n        <div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\">\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">h1</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>Xiaoli's homepage<span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">h1</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">p</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>I like climbing mountains and taking pictures. <span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">p</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">a</span> <span class=\"terminal-a\">href</span>=<span class=\"terminal-g\">\"/photos\"</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>View my photo album<span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">a</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n        </div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">view-source:https://my-first-page.vercel.app</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.8\">\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">1</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt;</span>Xiaoli’s homepage<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">2</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</span>I like hiking and taking pictures. <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">3</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a</span> <span style=\"color:var(--warning)\">href=\"/photos\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&gt;</span>View my photo album<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/a&gt;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:12px 14px;border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px\">Xiaoli's homepage</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:4px;outline:2px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px\">I like hiking and taking pictures. </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;margin-top:4px\">View my photo album →</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.8;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"background:var(--brand-light);border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/p&gt;</span></span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/a&gt;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Common tag recognition</div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Universal container</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Paragraph</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Link</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;img&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Picture</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Button</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;input&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Input box</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt; … &lt;/div&gt;</span>","when":"Use it to organize content and layout when there are no more appropriate semantic tags"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;</span>","when":"Titles and paragraphs, the skeleton of the article"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt; &lt;img&gt;</span>","when":"a jumps to the URL, img posts the picture"},{"demo":"<span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt; &lt;input&gt;</span>","when":"Interactive parts that can be clicked and filled on the page"}]},"usageMocks":{"html-reading":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">一份给人看的项目报告</span><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:left\">清楚的标题、重点、图片和章节<br>让读者快速扫到真正关心的内容</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">HTML 把内容变成阅读体验</span></div>","html-share":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:left\">🔒 report.example.com/launch</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%;justify-content:space-between\"><b style=\"font-size:13px\">新品发布报告</b><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">打开网页</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">发一个网址，对方用浏览器就能看</span></div>","html-interactive":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">▶ 视频</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">↗ 链接</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">填写表单</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">页面可提供媒体、链接和表单等交互元素</span></div>","html-from-markdown":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"># 发布计划<br>- 本周上线</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px\"><b style=\"display:block;font-size:13px\">发布计划</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">· 本周上线</span></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Markdown 负责写，HTML 负责呈现</span>","html-unclosed-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">&lt;div&gt; 卡片<br><span style=\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--red)\">后续内容可能仍处于该元素内…</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">缺少 &lt;/div&gt; 会使 DOM 结构与预期不一致</span></div>","html-cross-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;文字&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">标签交叉嵌套，浏览器会按容错规则重排</span></div>","html-head-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">&lt;head&gt; 欢迎来到我的网站</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">结构无效，浏览器可能按容错规则把内容移到 body</span></div>","html-word-bad":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:26px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">W</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">index.html → 另存为 .docx</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">DOCX 不是 HTML；浏览器不会将其作为网页结构解析</span></div>"}}}